WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.854
The kids had to go to the dentist.

2
00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:21.489
But Oliver wouldn't get in the car.

3
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:28.589
"I don't want to go!" yelled Oliver.

4
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:33.013
"It's just a checkup," said Mom.

5
00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:37.976
"The dentist won't hurt you," said Harry.

6
00:00:37.977 --> 00:00:44.093
"I don't like the dentist!" yelled Oliver.

7
00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:48.435
"She'll just clean your teeth," said Dad.

8
00:00:48.436 --> 00:00:53.548
"Her chair goes up and down," said Emmy.

9
00:00:53.549 --> 00:00:57.278
Oliver still wouldn't move.

10
00:00:57.279 --> 00:01:01.322
Emmy frowned.

11
00:01:01.323 --> 00:01:09.568
They were going to be late.

12
00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:14.123
"I know what to do," said Emmy.

13
00:01:14.124 --> 00:01:21.623
She ran inside to get something.

14
00:01:21.624 --> 00:01:24.259
"Here, Oliver," she said.

15
00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:28.047
"Your teddy bear likes the dentist.

16
00:01:28.048 --> 00:01:36.679
Why don't you take him with you?"

17
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:44.984
"Oh . . . ," said Oliver.

18
00:01:44.985 --> 00:01:56.938
"Okay. Let's go!"

19
00:01:56.939 --> 00:02:04.895
Oliver had the first appointment.

20
00:02:04.896 --> 00:02:11.489
"Your teeth look great, Oliver," said Dr. Cool.

21
00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:17.654
"Thanks for the new toothbrush," said Oliver.

22
00:02:17.655 --> 00:02:30.048
Next it was Harry's turn.

23
00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:35.922
"Your teeth look great too, Harry," said Dr. Cool.

24
00:02:35.923 --> 00:02:39.045
"Now it's my turn," said Emmy.

25
00:02:39.046 --> 00:02:51.168
"My teeth always look great."

26
00:02:51.169 --> 00:03:00.461
"Hmm . . . I see a little cavity," said Dr. Cool.

27
00:03:00.462 --> 00:03:04.777
"A cavity?" said Emmy.

28
00:03:04.778 --> 00:03:08.144
"Yes," said Dr. Cool.

29
00:03:08.145 --> 00:03:15.948
"You'll have to come back for a filling."

30
00:03:15.949 --> 00:03:22.168
"I don't want to go to the dentist!" yelled Emmy.

31
00:03:22.169 --> 00:03:27.737
Oliver ran to get something for Emmy.

32
00:03:27.738 --> 00:03:34.793
It was his teddy bear.
